/* 6位常驻NPC熟稔后的日常额外线（6人 × 3段 = 18段，无初次见面套话，含检定与具体反馈） */

:: MP Extra Daily Sera 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
打烊后的钟表铺没拉外帘，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把那只只有你常用的蓝边瓷杯倒满锡兰红茶，顺手将备用铜钥匙推到你手边：「今晚去后巷取一批定制发条，你帮我拿着提灯。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回落脚处 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[接过提灯带路 (0:06)|MP Extra Daily Sera 2]]>>
	<<pass 6>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
		<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_fam_sera_1")>><<money 150>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[清点旧垫片 (0:06)|MP Extra Daily Sera 2]]>>
	<<pass 6>>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
		<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_fam_sera_1_keepsake")>><<money 150>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>

:: MP Extra Daily Sera 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
旧街石板路映着昏黄路灯，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>自然地挽住你的手臂避开积水洼。老铁匠从半掩的木门里递出两盒淬火发条，笑着问<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>什么时候把铺子楼上的空房也拾掇出来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回落脚处 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[接过发条盒 (0:06)|MP Extra Daily Sera 3]]>>
	<<pass 6>>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
		<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_fam_sera_2")>><<money 200>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">替塞拉接过沉重的发条盒 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[核对钢印成色 (0:06)|MP Extra Daily Sera 3]]>>
	<<pass 6>>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
		<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_fam_sera_2_keepsake")>><<money 200>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>

